{"Categories":[1,9],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[6],"Id":103,"TextResource":{"Name":"salon-vip-american-admirals-club","Translations":[{"Text":"Sal\u00f3n VIP \"American Admirals Club\"","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Sal\u00f3n VIP \"American Admirals Club\"","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"2","Id":185}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Servicios \u00fanicos enfocados en su descanso, relajo y comodidad, a pasos del embarque y de su nuevo vuelo internacional es lo que promete el sal\u00f3n del grupo American Airlines a sus pasajeros m\u00e1s reputados. Experiencia y elegancia en un solo lugar.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Unique services designed for your rest, relaxation and comfort a few steps from the boarding gate to your new international flight. This is what the American Airlines Group has promised to its most reputed passengers. Experience and chic atmosphere in a single place.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916788","Updated":"1489712624","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/103_salon-vip-american-admirals-club.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/364\/node\/374","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/364\/node\/374","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/103_salon-vip-american-admirals-club.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/103\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/103_salon-vip-american-admirals-club.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/103\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}